No law text is published. This repository holds metadata only.

The facts in each file (title, document type, number, date signed, publication date, electronic publication number,
signing body) come from the metadata API of the Official Internet Portal of Legal Information
(ÐžÑ„Ð¸Ñ†Ð¸Ð°Ð»ÑŒÐ½Ñ‹Ð¹ Ð¸Ð½Ñ‚ÐµÑ€Ð½ÐµÑ‚-Ð¿Ð¾Ñ€Ñ‚Ð°Ð» Ð¿Ñ€Ð°Ð²Ð¾Ð²Ð¾Ð¹ Ð¸Ð½Ñ„Ð¾Ñ€Ð¼Ð°Ñ†Ð¸Ð¸), http://publication.pravo.gov.ru, whose open-data terms let anyone
reuse its data freely, including commercially, provided it is used lawfully, not distorted, and a link to the source
is kept: http://publication.pravo.gov.ru/OpenData. Each file links to the act's own page on the portal.

Laws and other official documents are not objects of copyright in Russia (Civil Code, art. 1259(6)(1)); none of their
text is reproduced here in any case.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
